{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/b013c00dfbfa362f64e1ac03c2c51ba0.poster.avif?t=1771413255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/b013c00dfbfa362f64e1ac03c2c51ba0.webm?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/b013c00dfbfa362f64e1ac03c2c51ba0.mp4?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Last Front \u2014 a modern RTS with deep tactical gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Front is inspired by the great real-time strategies of the 90s and 2000s, preserving the spirit of classic RTS while bringing the action into a realistic modern military world. Build bases, develop your economy, command armies, and apply advanced technologies to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At release, you\u2019ll find three main factions, each with its own doctrine of warfare:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RVI (Initiative of the Radical Voice)</strong> \u2014 a fictional Middle Eastern organization focused on stealth, ambushes, raids, and mobile strike groups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Russia</strong> \u2014 heavy armored vehicles, powerful artillery, and a skillful combination of defense and large-scale counterattacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USA</strong> \u2014 high-tech weaponry, precision airstrikes, and reconnaissance superiority.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Add the game to your wishlist to not miss the demo and updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/6e04ae276571094141498ae1a5d8d32e.poster.avif?t=1771413255\" width=376 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/6e04ae276571094141498ae1a5d8d32e.webm?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/6e04ae276571094141498ae1a5d8d32e.mp4?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/03009b7d40c26d0b9d043ef22caa20e6.poster.avif?t=1771413255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/03009b7d40c26d0b9d043ef22caa20e6.webm?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/03009b7d40c26d0b9d043ef22caa20e6.mp4?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/a3b8ec2b1959739017362c125619164d.poster.avif?t=1771413255\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/a3b8ec2b1959739017362c125619164d.webm?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/a3b8ec2b1959739017362c125619164d.mp4?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction is divided into <strong>unique combat commands</strong> \u2014 special generals or divisions with their own tactics and exclusive units:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Russia: <strong>Strategic Missile Forces</strong> specializing in long-range missile weaponry and strategic strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the USA: <strong>Air Command</strong>, focusing on fighters, attack aircraft, and helicopters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the RVI: generals armed with unconventional solutions \u2014 suicide drones, ambushes, covert movements, and biological weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is only part of the available commands \u2014 each faction will have 2\u20133 different commanders, each unlocking a new set of units and a unique style of warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/0ee36cc48d142e8e19fa6eab96e34031.poster.avif?t=1771413255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/0ee36cc48d142e8e19fa6eab96e34031.webm?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/0ee36cc48d142e8e19fa6eab96e34031.mp4?t=1771413255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic modern setting</strong> \u2014 modern combat vehicles, helicopters, drones, and unique units with authentic weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique factions and playstyles</strong> \u2014 choose the style of warfare that suits you, from fast mobile air forces to heavy armored vehicles and defensive structures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent AI and multiple difficulty levels</strong> \u2014 from beginner to veteran 